WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
That's it

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,040
A few low-level lonely ghosts

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:06,010
It’s also worth dispatching such a large formation, Captain Chen

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:06,970
Not me

5
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:08,610
For this level of business

6
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:09,610
I'll go in alone

7
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:11,130
It can be done in ten minutes at most

8
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,920
Just wait in the car.

9
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:28,220
By the way, help me order a takeaway. Everyone got off the car and got ready for action. Zhang Wei

10
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:29,460
Put away your flute

11
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,660
According to the tactical regulations of the 749th Bureau

12
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,700
Field operations must involve the entire team working together to cover each other.

13
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,660
No one is allowed to leave the team without permission

14
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,620
All right, all right, I'll listen to you

15
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:49,940
You are the vice-captain. You have the final say. Why don't you leave?

16
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,820
Let brothers turn on the insurance
